{"id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-lp-space.md","title":"$L^p$ Space","display":"df-lp-space — $L^p$ Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-lp-space","aliases":["58-df-lp-space","L^p Space"],"display":"df-lp-space — $L^p$ Space","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[58-df-measure-space]]","[[58-df-measurable-function]]","[[58-df-integral]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-lp-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-lp-space</span><span>L^p Space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lp-space — <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^p\">\\(L^p\\)</span> Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"58-df-measurable-function\">58-df-measurable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"58-df-integral\">58-df-integral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,L,F_p\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,L,F_p\\in V\\)</span> (measure data, output quotient, and representative set)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in[1,\\infty]\">\\(p\\in[1,\\infty]\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\)</span> (measure-space predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function-graph predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)))\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)))\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"58-df-measurable-function\">58-df-measurable-function</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S(f,g;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S(f,g;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span> (fully parameterized almost-everywhere equality defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S(L,p;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S(L,p;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span> (set-output relation defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\(L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|\\cdot\\|_{L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)}\">\\(\\|\\cdot\\|_{L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)}\\)</span> 的定义域与公式见下文。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\((X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span> 下，旧记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[f]_{\\sim_{\\mu\\text{-a.e.}}}\">\\([f]_{\\sim_{\\mu\\text{-a.e.}}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[f]_{\\mu\\text{-a.e.}}\">\\([f]_{\\mu\\text{-a.e.}}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[f]_{\\sim_\\mu}\">\\([f]_{\\sim_\\mu}\\)</span> 均表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\(\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|\\cdot\\|_{L^p(X,\\mu)}\">\\(\\|\\cdot\\|_{L^p(X,\\mu)}\\)</span> 是省略已固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> 的同一范数记号。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb C}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb C:\\forall z\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbb C\\;(|w-z|&lt;r\\to w\\in U)\\}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb C}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb C:\\forall z\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbb C\\;(|w-z|&lt;r\\to w\\in U)\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)=\\sigma_{\\mathbb C}(\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\">\\(\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)=\\sigma_{\\mathbb C}(\\tau_{\\mathbb C})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_X\">\\(\\sigma_X\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在积分中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|f|^p\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,|f(x)|^p\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\">\\(|f|^p\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,|f(x)|^p\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb C)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in[1,\\infty)\">\\(p\\in[1,\\infty)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lp\\text{-}space\\text{-}ae}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S(f,g;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,X,\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)))\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(g;(X,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq g(x)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land\\mu(\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq g(x)\\})=0.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lp\\text{-}space\\text{-}ae}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S(f,g;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,X,\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)))\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(g;(X,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq g(x)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land\\mu(\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq g(x)\\})=0.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lp\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S(L,p;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\np\\in[1,\\infty]\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\\exists F_p\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;F_p=\\Bigl\\{f\\in\\mathcal P(X\\times\\mathbb C):\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}\\land\\Bigl[\n(p\\in[1,\\infty)\\land\\int_X|f|^p\\,d\\mu&lt;\\infty)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\lor(p=\\infty\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;(\n\\{x\\in X:|f(x)|&gt;M\\}\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land\\mu(\\{x\\in X:|f(x)|&gt;M\\})=0))\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land L=\\Bigl\\{C\\in\\mathcal P(F_p):\\exists f\\in F_p\\;\\bigl(\nC=\\{g\\in F_p:\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S(f,g;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lp\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S(L,p;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\np\\in[1,\\infty]\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\\exists F_p\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;F_p=\\Bigl\\{f\\in\\mathcal P(X\\times\\mathbb C):\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{17mm}\\land\\Bigl[\n(p\\in[1,\\infty)\\land\\int_X|f|^p\\,d\\mu&lt;\\infty)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\lor(p=\\infty\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;(\n\\{x\\in X:|f(x)|&gt;M\\}\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land\\mu(\\{x\\in X:|f(x)|&gt;M\\})=0))\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land L=\\Bigl\\{C\\in\\mathcal P(F_p):\\exists f\\in F_p\\;\\bigl(\nC=\\{g\\in F_p:\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S(f,g;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)=\n\\{g\\in\\mathbb C^X:\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S(f,g;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)=\n\\{g\\in\\mathbb C^X:\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S(f,g;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land p\\in[1,\\infty]\n\\ \\to\\ L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)=\n\\bigcup\\{L\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(X\\times\\mathbb C))):\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S(L,p;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land p\\in[1,\\infty]\n\\ \\to\\ L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)=\n\\bigcup\\{L\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(X\\times\\mathbb C))):\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S(L,p;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land p\\in[1,\\infty)\n\\land u\\in L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land f\\in u\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\|u\\|_{L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)}=\n\\left(\\int_X|f|^p\\,d\\mu\\right)^{1/p}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land p\\in[1,\\infty)\n\\land u\\in L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land f\\in u\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\|u\\|_{L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)}=\n\\left(\\int_X|f|^p\\,d\\mu\\right)^{1/p}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land u\\in L^\\infty(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land f\\in u\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\|u\\|_{L^\\infty(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)}=\n\\inf\\{M\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}:\\{x\\in X:|f(x)|&gt;M\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(\\{x\\in X:|f(x)|&gt;M\\})=0\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land u\\in L^\\infty(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land f\\in u\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\|u\\|_{L^\\infty(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)}=\n\\inf\\{M\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}:\\{x\\in X:|f(x)|&gt;M\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(\\{x\\in X:|f(x)|&gt;M\\})=0\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Almost-everywhere equality now carries the measure space and measurability guards; an arbitrary pair of functions need not have a measurable disagreement set.</li>\n<li>The quotient is the bounded set of explicit equivalence classes, not an untyped quotient term.  When the relation holds, write <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\">\\(L=L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^p(\\mu)\">\\(L^p(\\mu)\\)</span> is complete (Banach space) for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1 \\leq p \\leq \\infty\">\\(1 \\leq p \\leq \\infty\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^2(\\mu)\">\\(L^2(\\mu)\\)</span> is a Hilbert space</li>\n<li>Inclusions: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^q \\subseteq L^p\">\\(L^q \\subseteq L^p\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q &gt; p\">\\(q &gt; p\\)</span> when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(X) &lt; \\infty\">\\(\\mu(X) &lt; \\infty\\)</span></li>\n<li>Riesz-Fischer: completeness proof</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Real and Complex Analysis</li>\n<li>Folland, Real Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measurable-function","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measurable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-integral","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-integral]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measurable-function","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)))$ (see [[58-df-measurable-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau_{\\mathbb C}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb C:\\forall z\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbb C\\;(|w-z|<r\\to w\\in U)\\}$，$\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)=\\sigma_{\\mathbb C}(\\tau_{\\mathbb C})$；$\\sigma_X$ 使用 [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L^p","display":false},{"tex":"X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,L,F_p\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in[1,\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S(f,g;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S(L,p;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\|\\cdot\\|_{L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)}","display":false},{"tex":"(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"[f]_{\\sim_{\\mu\\text{-a.e.}}}","display":false},{"tex":"[f]_{\\mu\\text{-a.e.}}","display":false},{"tex":"[f]_{\\sim_\\mu}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\|\\cdot\\|_{L^p(X,\\mu)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb C}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb C:\\forall z\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall w\\in\\mathbb C\\;(|w-z|<r\\to w\\in U)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)=\\sigma_{\\mathbb C}(\\tau_{\\mathbb C})","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_X","display":false},{"tex":"|f|^p\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,|f(x)|^p\\rangle:x\\in X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb C)","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in[1,\\infty)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lp\\text{-}space\\text{-}ae}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S(f,g;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,X,\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)))\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(g;(X,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)))\\\\\n&\\land\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq g(x)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land\\mu(\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq g(x)\\})=0.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lp\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S(L,p;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow{}&\np\\in[1,\\infty]\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land\\exists F_p\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&F_p=\\Bigl\\{f\\in\\mathcal P(X\\times\\mathbb C):\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(X,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)))\\\\\n&\\hspace{17mm}\\land\\Bigl[\n(p\\in[1,\\infty)\\land\\int_X|f|^p\\,d\\mu<\\infty)\\\\\n&\\hspace{34mm}\\lor(p=\\infty\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;(\n\\{x\\in X:|f(x)|>M\\}\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land\\mu(\\{x\\in X:|f(x)|>M\\})=0))\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr\\}\\\\\n&\\land L=\\Bigl\\{C\\in\\mathcal P(F_p):\\exists f\\in F_p\\;\\bigl(\nC=\\{g\\in F_p:\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S(f,g;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(f;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)=\n\\{g\\in\\mathbb C^X:\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S(f,g;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land p\\in[1,\\infty]\n\\ \\to\\ L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)=\n\\bigcup\\{L\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(X\\times\\mathbb C))):\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S(L,p;X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land p\\in[1,\\infty)\n\\land u\\in L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land f\\in u\\\\\n&\\quad\\to\\|u\\|_{L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)}=\n\\left(\\int_X|f|^p\\,d\\mu\\right)^{1/p}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land u\\in L^\\infty(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\land f\\in u\\\\\n&\\quad\\to\\|u\\|_{L^\\infty(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)}=\n\\inf\\{M\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}:\\{x\\in X:|f(x)|>M\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(\\{x\\in X:|f(x)|>M\\})=0\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"L=L^p(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"L^p(\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"1 \\leq p \\leq \\infty","display":false},{"tex":"L^2(\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"L^q \\subseteq L^p","display":false},{"tex":"q > p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu(X) < \\infty","display":false}],"bytes":4381,"backlinks":[{"id":"dbdc45afd5f344e4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$F\\cdot G$ 只在固定 $(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)$ 的可测等价类上使用；商范数记号与 [[../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md]] 的范数按下式对接。"},{"id":"3ce8a66e6c0444a6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S$ and $\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S$ (the canonical $L^p$ quotient and almost-everywhere equality, see [[../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md]])"},{"id":"ef06f79774aa2541","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$u\\in L^p(\\Omeg